== the page as text
A report
========

Some slanted, both, under and plain
words, more than a line holds, <and> &
"quoted".

  kk
 rrrr

bbg

Rent    500
Food    300
        800
Odd   #DIV0


 +-------+
 |  cpu  |-------+
 |       |       |
 +-------+       |
                 |
                 v
             +-------+
             |  mem  |
 a note      |       |
             +-------+

Rent  ################## 500
Food  ########### 300
      ############################## 800

[no sheet nosuch]
